@startuml
[*] --> Homepage : Initial State
Homepage --> Projects view : User selects a project from the navigation bar
Projects view --> Photos view : User chooses to view photos of a selected project
Projects view --> Videos view : User chooses to watch videos of a selected project
Projects view --> Career Opportunities view : User navigates away from projects
Career Opportunities view --> Updates view : User chooses to view updates
Career Opportunities view --> Application Form view : User chooses to open an application form for employment or internship
Application Form view --> [*] : User submits a job application
[*] --> Homepage : User navigates back to homepage

@enduml
